r counterplay) Bxb5 (winning the bishop)\nOr: Be7 Bxa6 Rd8+ Kc7 Rd7+ (with overwhelming position)\n\n**Motif:** quietMove / backRankMate (the move threatens unstoppable Rd8# and sets up the win of the b5 bishop)\n\n**Explanation:** White's d6-bishop moves to e7, threatening Rd8# which would be checkmate (the rook on d8 controls the back rank and the king has no escape squares). Black's main tries are ...Bxa6 (taking the pawn) or ...c3 (advancing the pawn for counterplay). After ...c3, the b5 bishop becomes undefended and White captures it with Bxb5, winning a clean piece. After ...Bxa6, White plays Rd8+ with a forced sequence of checks that wins material or delivers mate. This is a powerful pattern: when the opponent's king is confined, a quiet move can threaten unstoppable tactics that are hard to defend against.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Be7\", \"line\": [\"Be7\", \"c3\", \"Bxb5\", \"Bxe5\", \"Rd8+\", \"Kc7\"], \"motifs\": [\"quietMove\", \"backRankMate\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27", "square": "d6"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27", "square": "d1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27", "square": "c8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27", "move": "Bf8"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2k4r/p5pp/P2Bp3/1b2Pp2/2p1p3/8/4B1Pb/3R1K2 w - - 0 27", "move": "Bb8"}}, {"tool